			"Message": "feat(Maintain/Build): Add Node.js sidecar version bundling support\n\nThis update enables the build orchestrator to dynamically bundle specific Node.js versions as sidecars for the Cocoon extension host, advancing the Land editor's MVP Path A strategy. Key changes include:\n- Added `NodeVersion` argument to select a pre-downloaded Node.js executable\n- Implemented platform-specific target triple detection for sidecar binaries\n- Extended JSON configuration editing to inject sidecar paths into Tauri's `externalBin`\n- Added temporary staging and cleanup of sidecar binaries in `Element/Mountain/Binary`\n\nThese changes allow Land to bundle optimized Node.js runtimes with Cocoon, ensuring compatibility with VS Code extensions while maintaining the project's declarative build architecture. The binaries (`Build.exe`, `Maintain.exe`) are rebuilt to reflect these source changes.",
			"SHA": "a1fe1f28c997756ba94cd5247c04c6d287799463"
		},
